	tristate "OMAP Hardware Spinlock device"
	depends on ARCH_OMAP4 || SOC_OMAP5 || SOC_DRA7XX || SOC_AM33XX || SOC_AM43XX || ARCH_K3 || COMPILE_TEST
	help
	  Say y here to support the OMAP Hardware Spinlock device (firstly
	  introduced in OMAP4).
